differential2 §2 (default 64-bit int). PLR: ints are unbounded so
10**20 > 0 holds. The default signedbv[64] model overflows, so this
KNOWNBUG regex (the PLR-correct SUCCESSFUL) currently cannot be met.
intrinsic-int-overflow-unbounded is the same program with
--python-unbounded-ints, which restores the PLR behaviour.
